A vintage 1950s-style Chinese travel poster aesthetic showing a bustling airport café scene in Xi'an, featuring a circular green mermaid-like logo sign glowing warmly above a counter, young women in green aprons serving steaming cups to travelers, traditional Chinese architectural elements blending with mid-century modern furniture, warm amber lighting from hanging pendant lamps, plates of dumplings and noodles alongside coffee cups on lacquered tables, soft muted colors of jade green, cream, and terracotta, grainy texture reminiscent of aged lithograph prints, conveying cultural fusion and imitation as homage.
